OL,5,G1700 Flipping Bangers
OL,6,     FMercedes: Will and Gus splash out
OL,7,     F550 pounds on a garage owner's
OL,8,     FMercedes 190. The previous owner
OL,9,     Fhas failed to fix it, but the duo
OL,10,     Fare more confident.
OL,11,G1800 Flipping Bangers
OL,12,     FMazda: Will and Gus take on a
OL,13,     FMazda MX-5 that's been given some
OL,14,     Freal boy racer attitude, hoping to
OL,15,     Freturn it to its former glory.
OL,16,G1900 Flipping Bangers
OL,17,     FMetro: Will and Gus track down a
OL,18,     F1980s Austin Metro. It's cheap,
OL,19,     Fit's clean and it's bright yellow
OL,20,     F- and they have high hopes to
OL,21,     Ftreble their money.
